>For periods with a likely activity measure, we notice that most of the individuals take part in light activities. We should also expect some higher level of intense activities as seen from the maximum value.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":7,"id":"eeba347d","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.718991Z","iopub.status.busy":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.717456Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.853218Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.848879Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.148167,"end_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.857615","exception":false,"start_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.709448","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["# Data Preparation\n","\n","mets_stats <- mets %>%\n","filter(mets_pro_mins > 0 ) %>% # Neglecting METs indicating no activity.\n","summarise(max_mets = max(mets_pro_mins), min_mets = min(mets_pro_mins), avg_mets = mean(mets_pro_mins), stdv =sd(mets_pro_mins))\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":8,"id":"45680b44","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.87861Z","iopub.status.busy":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.876878Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.906484Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.904604Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.042977,"end_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.909422","exception":false,"start_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:46.866445","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/html":["<table class=\"dataframe\">\n","<caption>A tibble: 1 × 4</caption>\n","<thead>\n","\t<tr><th scope=col>max_mets</th><th scope=col>min_mets</th><th scope=col>avg_mets</th><th scope=col>stdv</th></tr>\n","\t<tr><th scope=col>&lt;dbl&gt;</th><th scope=col>&lt;dbl&gt;</th><th scope=col>&lt;dbl&gt;</th><th scope=col>&lt;dbl&gt;</th></tr>\n","</thead>\n","<tbody>\n","\t<tr><td>140</td><td>0.1</td><td>1.167001</td><td>2.934299</td></tr>\n","</tbody>\n","</table>\n"],"text/latex":["A tibble: 1 × 4\n","\\begin{tabular}{llll}\n"," max\\_mets & min\\_mets & avg\\_