kdown","id":"1b871fc0","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.009588,"end_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:50.520821","exception":false,"start_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:50.511233","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## Summary of Analysis\n","\n","Assuming the more energy consuming an activity is, there more likely an individual will benefit from drinking more water, reduces our focus on roughly 8% of the individuals. These individuals take part in **Medium** and **Vigorous** activities.\n","\n","- About 2% of the individuals take part in vigorous night activities, 4% in medium. For these indivduals, conducting further analysis on their sleeping habits, could help in making recommendation about using the **Spring product** after 10PM.\n","- More generally, conducting a survey to find out the kind of activity they are actually involved in, should help make recommendation about the **Spring product**.\n"]}],"metadata":{"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"datasetId":2178893,"sourceId":3637697,"sourceType":"datasetVersion"}],"dockerImageVersionId":30186,"isGpuEnabled":false,"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"r","sourceType":"notebook"},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"R","language":"R","name":"ir"},"language_info":{"codemirror_mode":"r","file_extension":".r","mimetype":"text/x-r-source","name":"R","pygments_lexer":"r","version":"4.0.5"},"papermill":{"default_parameters":{},"duration":12.821433,"end_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:50.652104","environment_variables":{},"exception":null,"input_path":"__notebook__.ipynb","output_path":"__notebook__.ipynb","parameters":{},"start_time":"2025-12-17T22:20:37.830671","version":"2.3.4"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}